{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07206","headline":"送史九赴任宁陵兼呈单父史八时监察五兄初入台 · 刘长卿","name":"送史九赴任宁陵兼呈单父史八时监察五兄初入台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"趋府弟联兄，看君此去荣。\n春随千里道，河带万家城。\n绣服棠花映，青袍草色迎。\n梁园修竹在，持赠结交情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07206.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07206","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}